<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:48.360
Being seen is my purpose in life.

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:49.160
I don't know what 
you're talking about.

00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:52.500
Showing my face 
in the preview excites me.

00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:53.160
I see.

00:23:53.160 --> 00:23:55.870
Look forward to hearing 
more of my sexy voice.

